    "description": {
      "value": "Hunters all over Golarion favor curare, a potent paralytic derived from boiled tree bark.\n\nDC: 25\nSaving Throw: Fortitude\nMaximum Duration: 6 rounds (but see stage 3)\n- Stage 1: 2d6 poison damage, clumsy 1, and enfeebled 1 (1 round)\n- Stage 2: 3d6 poison damage, clumsy 2, enfeebled 2, and slowed 1 (1 minute)\n- Stage 3: 4d6 poison damage, clumsy 2, enfeebled 2, and slowed 1. If the victim fails the saving throw while at Stage 3, the poison ends and the victim is paralyzed for 2d6 minutes. (1 round)\n\nActivate (2 Actions); Components Interact"
